# Build context ignore rules for the SAM2 image ONLY.
#
# BuildKit prefers `<dockerfile-path>.dockerignore` over the context-root `.dockerignore`, and
# that is exactly what is needed here: both images build from the `server/` context, but they
# need opposite things from it.
#
#   server/.dockerignore                  excludes sam_service  -> keeps torch OUT of the API image
#   server/sam_service/Dockerfile.dockerignore  (this file)     -> keeps sam_service IN
#
# Without this file the API's exclusion applies to the SAM build too and the image cannot copy
# its own source ("/sam_service": not found).
.venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.omc
.env
# `.env` 는 정확히 그 이름만 막는다 — `.env.local`·`.env.bak.*` 가 새어 나간다
# (2026-08-26 api 이미지에서 실제로 발생). 글로브로 전부 막는다.
.env*
.python-version
.dockerignore

# The SAM service does not need the main backend, its tests, or the experiment harness.
app/
tests/
scripts/
ab_out/
prompts/
docs/
